  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1602.18 Generator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1602.18 “Generator” means the person who holds title to the septage treatment facility or has been issued an exceptional quality certificate in accordance with Env-Wq 1610 and produces or distributes septage solids.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
